<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ANTWERP, Belgium 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-round results in</p>
<p>the $1 million European Community tennis championship on Monday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat Martin Sinner (Germany) 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 4-6 6-1</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>5-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Bernd Karbacher (Germany) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Dick Norman (Belgium) beat Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) 5-2</p>
<p>(Ulihrach retired injured)</p>
<p>Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) beat Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) 3-6 6-4 7-5</p>
</text>
